WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.392 --> 00:00:08.354
To the outside world the Amish seem kind, loving, generous.

00:00:08.896 --> 00:00:10.523
But the odds of an Amish woman getting raped

00:00:10.523 --> 00:00:12.525
by a guy within their own community?

00:00:12.525 --> 00:00:14.068
It's one out of every six...

00:00:14.068 --> 00:00:15.069
on a good day.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.864
First perpetrator was my biological father.

00:00:18.865 --> 00:00:20.033
I was five.

00:00:21.367 --> 00:00:23.620
The Amish carved out a different way of existing.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.122
The church wields power and control.

00:00:26.122 --> 00:00:29.667
Under the church, the wives only have as much voice

00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:31.085
as their husbands allow.

00:00:31.085 --> 00:00:33.963
They bussed in four busloads of Amish people.

00:00:33.963 --> 00:00:36.633
Not a single one of them was there in court for me.

00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:38.801
Amish communities view going to the police

00:00:38.801 --> 00:00:41.220
as a greater sin than the rape itself.

00:00:41.346 --> 00:00:43.431
It's a predator's paradise.

00:00:44.557 --> 00:00:47.268
It takes a courageous person
to go against that community.

00:00:48.227 --> 00:00:50.104
Sometimes we have to face our biggest fear.

00:00:51.314 --> 00:00:54.025
He wants two years work release,
no incarceration.

00:00:54.025 --> 00:00:54.984
He is a pedophile!

00:00:55.818 --> 00:00:57.320
We are the crack in the dam.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:58.738
But when that flood comes,

00:00:58.946 --> 00:01:00.948
justice has to follow.

